---
import { fxRates } from '../../data/content';
---
<section id="ruta" class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-ink"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
<div>
<p class="kick text-amber-400">Ruta marítima principal</p>
<h2 class="h mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white">Shanghai / Ningbo → Manzanillo</h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Conectamos Asia con México con servicios seguros y tiempos competitivos. Tránsito marítimo promedio de 30–45 días, puerto a puerto, con bodegas consolidadoras en Shenzhen, Ningbo y Yiwu.</p>
<a href="#navieras" class="btn ghost mt-6">Ver ruta completa →</a>
</div>
<div class="mono p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-xs lg:max-w-sm lg:justify-self-end w-full"><p class="text-slate-300 mb-2 tracking-widest">FX · INDICATIVO</p>
<div class="space-y-2">{fxRates.map(f => <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-white">{f.pair}</span><span class="text-slate-200">{f.rate}</span><span class={f.up ? 'text-emerald-400' : 'text-red-400'}>{f.change}</span></div>)}</div></div>
</div></section>
